description:
Installation of intake and extract grilles on east elevation;
Installation of externally illuminated central fixed raised metal laser cut letters applied individually on background, to the fascia either side of entrance door;
Installation of partition walls to form accessible WC and office space, including new MF ceiling to conceal ventilation and pipework;
Installation of stainless steel sheeting with Tarkett finish fixed to floor and associated works to create kitchen and coordination area for bakery use;
Retention of bank counter, with new bar area to rear;
Mechanical ventilation to bakery, with installation of cable tray to ceiling to hold lighting, AC cassettes and an air curtain over the entrance;
Installation of new cladding and skirting  to match existing internal detailing, existing wall cladding to remain unchanged.
